icipation and engagement in \nactivities execution, CI adapted the format and \napproach to the Executive and Steering Committee \nmeetings, which took place quarterly since early 2018.  \n\nThe observation is accepted, \nthe word is corrected. Page 32. \n\nThe observation is accepted, \nthe detail is included. Page 32. \n\n \n\x0cIn 2020 and 2021, coordination was carried out \nbilaterally with IFC, UNEP-FI and other Steering \nCommittee members, such as civil society partners \nand governmental entities.  \n\nIn May 2021, the online event “Matopiba +” was \norganized by CI as a 3-day webinar to promote \nknowledge exchange and disseminate project results. \nThe presentations were carried out by project partners \nsuch as MAPA, EMBRAPA, local secretaries, IEB, \nRabobank, Lina Galvani Institute, etc. \nThere were regular global virtual meetings of the GGP! \nIt´s not clear if CI participated in all of them or not. \nPlease specify. \n\nPlease specify the date of these figures. \n\nPlease add years in the figure so clear to see \nexpenditures per year! Are the numbers 1-5 on the x \naxis referring to years?? \n\nPlease present all numbers as per standard in English \nwith commas separating the thousands and periods \nseparating the decimals. \nBeyond this work on monitoring progress in land \nregularization under Output 5.1.3, the scope of this \nOutcome also includes: Output 5.1.2. Progress and \nimpacts effectively monitored and lessons learned and \ndisseminated.  Output 5.1.4. Gender roles and impact \non women monitored and Output 5.1.5. Project/GEF \nmonitoring conducted (note the latter includes \nparticipation in Steering Committee). \nIn what way? Please expand on this comment. \n\nThe observation is accepted, \nthe information provided on the \nparagraph is corrected. Page \n32. \n\nThe observation is accepted, \nthe figure is corrected. Page \n33. \nThe x-axis corresponds to \nyears, from 2017 to 2021. The \ngraph already shows this \nclarification. Page 